WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:05.467
-Now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:08.767
President Biden has reportedly
been telling aides

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:11.434
in private
that he no longer recognizes

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:13.667
the Republican party
and views them

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.934
as an existential threat
to democracy.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:19.934
Oh, good, you're all caught up.

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:22.634
This is like when you watch
three episodes of a show

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:24.734
and you have to wait for
your partner to watch them

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.601
before you can move
to Episode 4.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:29.334
"I hope I can
remember what's going on.

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:32.033
It's been like a year."

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.934
President Biden
spoke today in Buffalo

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:36.801
and called on Congress
to pass new gun-control laws.

00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:40.234
Also today,
a tree fell in the forest.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.033
In a new interview,
Dr. Anthony Fauci criticized

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:47.701
the Trump administration's
handling of

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:50.868
the coronavirus pandemic and
said it "wasn't optimal,"

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:52.367
which is kind of
like saying

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:56.000
the Hindenburg
experienced a flight delay.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.300
In a new interview,
Supreme Court justice designate

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.734
Ketanji Brown Jackson
said the reality show

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:06.200
"Survivor"
is the best show ever.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.734
Well, at least you're prepared

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:10.267
for votes to not go your way.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:14.167
Sweden announced yesterday
it will apply to join NATO.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:16.767
Wow! First Finland, now Sweden.

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:19.701
It seems like every day,
we're learning about another

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:24.000
country we could have sworn
was already in NATO.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:29.234
The CDC this week advised
domestic travelers

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:30.834
to get tested
for the coronavirus

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:33.000
no more than
three days before their trip.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.400
Incidentally,
three days before the trip

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:40.033
is also when your dad thinks
you should get to the airport.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.501
"'Cause there might be traffic!

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:47.033
I'm not crazy.
There's been traffic before."

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:49.767
McDonald's announced yesterday
it would completely exit

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:52.400
the Russian market,
and that's not the only way

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.767
they're showing
their support for Ukraine.

00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:56.767
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:04.834
Surprised. I don't know why
that one was the one.

00:02:06.534 --> 00:02:11.200
Are you upset that, like --
that Grimace got painted?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.901
Do you guys know
he's supposed to be a taste bud?

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:18.834
I just found out.

00:02:18.834 --> 00:02:20.934
It's [bleep] disgusting,
but there you go.

00:02:24.901 --> 00:02:27.000
I'm just thrown.

00:02:28.234 --> 00:02:30.300
Police in Washington state
over the weekend said

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:33.000
that they had obtained video
of an Arby's manager

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.000
urinating into the
restaurant's milkshake machine.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.200
The manager did that?

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:42.634
Come on, man.
You got to learn to delegate.

00:02:46.234 --> 00:02:48.801
I don't think there's been
a single piece of good news

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.667
in tonight's monologue.

00:02:51.701 --> 00:02:53.534
And I know you were bummed out
by Grimace,

00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:55.601
but I got some good news.

00:02:55.601 --> 00:02:58.501
People are pissing
in the Arby's machines.

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:04.767
According to the latest numbers,
the new 28-step staircase

00:03:04.767 --> 00:03:06.601
that opened yesterday
at the Times Square

00:03:06.601 --> 00:03:09.067
subway station cost $30 million.

00:03:09.067 --> 00:03:11.667
Well, at least they finally
addressed the complaint

00:03:11.667 --> 00:03:14.834
that no one had
about the subway.

00:03:15.868 --> 00:03:17.200
"I don't mind the delays.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.501
I just wish
the steps were fancier.

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:26.000
I liked the rats.

00:03:26.968 --> 00:03:29.634
I just want new steps."

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.567
And, finally, it was announced
yesterday that

00:03:36.567 --> 00:03:39.167
"The Masked Singer" will return
for an eighth season,

00:03:39.167 --> 00:03:41.801
because they need somewhere
to put all the people

00:03:41.801 --> 00:03:44.200
too embarrassing for
"Dancing with the Stars."

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.734
♪♪

00:03:45.734 --> 00:03:48.267
President Biden
spoke yesterday in Buffalo

00:03:48.267 --> 00:03:50.667
and called for
an end to white supremacy.

00:03:50.667 --> 00:03:52.000
Well, good luck with that.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.000
You've been in Washington
a year and a half,

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.601
and so far,
the only thing Congress

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:59.701
has gotten rid of
is Daylight Saving Time.

00:03:59.701 --> 00:04:01.033
[ As Biden ]
Now that we took care of that,

00:04:01.033 --> 00:04:03.567
move on to white supremacy.

00:04:05.267 --> 00:04:08.734
We crushed Daylight Saving Time.
I mean..."

00:04:08.734 --> 00:04:10.200
[ Normal voice ]
President Biden, yesterday,

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.200
warned that democracy
is in danger.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.367
Even scarier, in a ransom note.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:19.200
Former president Trump
recently announced

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.701
he is writing a book titled
"The Crime of the Century"

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:23.167
about the alleged voter fraud

00:04:23.167 --> 00:04:25.200
in the
2020 presidential election.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.834
Look for it in your bookstore's
Tantrum section.

00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:33.634
Pennsylvania Lieutenant Governor
John Fetterman

00:04:33.634 --> 00:04:35.634
won last night's
Democratic Senate primary.

00:04:35.634 --> 00:04:37.467
Pretty impressive for a guy
who looks like

00:04:37.467 --> 00:04:41.067
a character from
"Mike Tyson's Punch-Out!!"

00:04:41.067 --> 00:04:45.067
He'll now go on to face
Soda Popinski in the general.

00:04:47.567 --> 00:04:50.434
North Carolina Representative
Madison Cawthorn, last night,

00:04:50.434 --> 00:04:52.033
lost his Republican primary.

00:04:52.033 --> 00:04:53.701
Hopefully he will
learn his lesson.

00:04:53.701 --> 00:04:58.501
Next time you get invited to
a cocaine orgy, just go.

00:05:02.567 --> 00:05:04.467
British Prime Minister
Boris Johnson

00:05:04.467 --> 00:05:08.000
recently called for Britons
to return to work in person

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.200
and said that his experience
working from home

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.567
included walking
to the fridge and

00:05:12.567 --> 00:05:15.100
"hacking off a
small piece of cheese,"

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:18.167
then forgetting what he's doing.

00:05:18.167 --> 00:05:19.434
Well, if it helps,

00:05:19.434 --> 00:05:24.067
you're supposed to be serving
as prime minister.

00:05:24.067 --> 00:05:25.767
Seems like that job
is big enough that

00:05:25.767 --> 00:05:29.100
a little piece of cheese
shouldn't throw you off it.

00:05:31.067 --> 00:05:32.300
In a recent interview,

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:35.868
Labor Secretary and former
Boston mayor Marty Walsh

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:38.067
said that Dunkin' Donuts
tasted different

00:05:38.067 --> 00:05:39.667
on a recent trip to South Korea.

00:05:39.667 --> 00:05:43.501
Said Biden, "You know that's not
why we sent you, right?"

00:05:47.767 --> 00:05:50.434
"Here's the report on
the Dunkins."

00:05:52.334 --> 00:05:55.300
According to a new poll,
1 in 3 Americans say that

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.300
the coronavirus pandemic
is over.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:00.801
Unfortunately, he's sitting
between the other two.

00:06:06.067 --> 00:06:08.667
"Great.
Between a couple of sheep."

00:06:10.868 --> 00:06:13.100
Archaeologists in Laos
recently discovered

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.467
an ancient tooth,
thought to have belonged to

00:06:15.467 --> 00:06:19.734
an extinct human species,
that was lodged in a cave wall.

00:06:19.734 --> 00:06:24.767
Experts believed their
last words were, "Not...cake."

00:06:29.567 --> 00:06:32.234
He -- He thought...

00:06:32.234 --> 00:06:34.701
So, to work backwards,

00:06:34.701 --> 00:06:37.634
he thought the wall was cake.

00:06:37.634 --> 00:06:40.434
And then he bit it and died.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:46.968
And, finally, the energy-drink
company Red Bull, last weekend,

00:06:46.968 --> 00:06:49.901
held its world paper-airplane
championship,

00:06:49.901 --> 00:06:53.567
while Four Loko launched its
first-annual Squid Games.

00:06:54.734 --> 00:06:58.167
Former President George W. Bush
spoke about Russia last night

00:06:58.167 --> 00:07:01.834
at an event in Dallas
and had quite the Freudian slip.

00:07:01.834 --> 00:07:04.400
-The decision of one man

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:09.868
to launch a wholly unjustified
and brutal invasion of Iraq --

00:07:09.868 --> 00:07:12.033
I mean, of Ukraine.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:12.033 --> 00:07:14.434
-Oof!

00:07:14.434 --> 00:07:17.834
That's like your wife
asking if you're hungry

00:07:17.834 --> 00:07:20.634
and saying, "I could cheat.
I mean, eat!"

00:07:20.634 --> 00:07:21.901
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.901 --> 00:07:24.300
"I could eat with my mistress.
Aghh!"

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:25.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:25.667 --> 00:07:27.767
President Biden yesterday
launched a program

00:07:27.767 --> 00:07:29.901
that activates military aircraft

00:07:29.901 --> 00:07:32.267
to import baby formula
from abroad.

00:07:32.267 --> 00:07:35.067
Said the French, "White or red?"

00:07:35.067 --> 00:07:40.534
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.534 --> 00:07:43.501
Health Secretary Xavier Becerra
tested positive yesterday

00:07:43.501 --> 00:07:46.200
for the coronavirus.
Wow, the health secretary.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.033
That's embarrassing.
That's like finding out

00:07:48.033 --> 00:07:50.601
the transportation secretary
got hit by a train.

00:07:50.601 --> 00:07:53.601
[ Laughter ]
He's fine. He's fine.

00:07:53.601 --> 00:07:56.901
President Biden yesterday
formally endorsed

00:07:56.901 --> 00:07:59.868
Finland and Sweden's application
to join NATO.

00:07:59.868 --> 00:08:02.200
Though if it's anything
like his past endorsements,

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.634
it probably hurt
more than it helped.

00:08:04.634 --> 00:08:06.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:06.701 --> 00:08:08.901
According to a new report,
the Secret Service

00:08:08.901 --> 00:08:11.434
is currently providing
protection for 33 people

00:08:11.434 --> 00:08:13.167
in the Biden administration
or family,

00:08:13.167 --> 00:08:14.634
as opposed to to Trump,

00:08:14.634 --> 00:08:17.267
where his administration
was his family.

00:08:17.267 --> 00:08:19.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.100
Elon Musk tweeted yesterday,
"Political attacks on me

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.167
will escalate dramatically
in coming months."

00:08:24.167 --> 00:08:26.200
And based on
his previous predictions,

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.400
this can only mean
that political attacks on him

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.534
will stop completely.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.534 --> 00:08:34.267
Health officials
in Massachusetts

00:08:34.267 --> 00:08:36.167
announced yesterday
that they have identified

00:08:36.167 --> 00:08:38.901
the first case of monkeypox
in the country.

00:08:38.901 --> 00:08:41.367
But don't worry,
it can be easily cured

00:08:41.367 --> 00:08:44.801
with, uh -- aw, baby formula!
Damn it!

00:08:44.801 --> 00:08:47.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:47.701 --> 00:08:50.868
Son of a bitch!

00:08:53.501 --> 00:08:56.367
The 75th Cannes Film Festival
began this week

00:08:56.367 --> 00:08:58.033
and included
a live video message

00:08:58.033 --> 00:09:00.701
from Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy.

00:09:00.701 --> 00:09:02.534
But this is weird.
It was just,

00:09:02.534 --> 00:09:05.067
"Please don't text
during the movie."

00:09:05.067 --> 00:09:08.000
[ Laughter ]

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.501
A 2-year-old boy in Texas
recently ordered

00:09:10.501 --> 00:09:12.133
31 cheeseburgers from McDonald's

00:09:12.133 --> 00:09:14.033
through the delivery app
DoorDash

00:09:14.033 --> 00:09:15.434
while playing
with his mom's phone.

00:09:15.434 --> 00:09:18.734
To be fair, in Texas,
That's just one button.

00:09:18.734 --> 00:09:22.100
[ Cheers and laughter ]

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:25.167
And finally,
the makers of Hot Pockets

00:09:25.167 --> 00:09:27.934
have unveiled a new line of
cheese and cold cut sandwiches

00:09:27.934 --> 00:09:30.968
called Deliwiches
that can be eaten hot or cold,

00:09:30.968 --> 00:09:34.334
as opposed to Hot Pockets,
which are always a mix of both.

00:09:34.334 --> 00:09:37.067
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

